      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "I'M FABULOUS (2) was in the money two back in a Grade 5 at Ballarat then jumped from a squeeze draw last time and was not far away when second (25.61) over 450m at Shepparton. Likely to improve sharply this time. PAW YARIS (3) made light work of a wide draw last time with a strong early sectional and clocking 28.17 in a 1.75 lengths win at Bendigo over 500m. Can measure up again. INDY'S CHARM (7) has a strong record this trip with two wins and two placings from five starts. Placed last time (19.29) at Healesville in a Grade 5, finishing second and beaten 0.6 lengths. Looks suited here and can measure up. PRESENCE (1) should bounce back after an unplaced effort here recently.",
